{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_forcer_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_forcer_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"出行計劃","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_forcer_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"7747290eb241d006c02ed598eff5fdc00fbf702e838810f812743c06c07fc87a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的......我都記下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太感謝你了，紅豆小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼好謝的，我知道的也不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"你想瞭解的關於卡茲戴爾的那些問題，我都回答不了......抱歉啊，幫不上什麼忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒這回事，請不要這麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"紅豆小姐願意教我那些薩卡茲的習俗，就已經是幫了大忙了。多虧紅豆小姐，我學到了很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"這沒什麼......不過我說你啊，在羅德島的時候這樣也就算了，可別以為我們薩卡茲都這麼好說話啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"換了卡茲戴爾，那情況就不同了。完全不同！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你不明白！就連那個好脾氣的安德切爾，我們都是在認識了很久之後才說上話的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"但你才加入幾天？你第一次接近我的時候，我還以為你是想找茬呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，原來當時紅豆小姐是因為這個原因，才表現得那麼警惕啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"我這樣都算好的了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......總之，你自己多小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"像你現在這樣，我真怕你們都走不到卡茲戴爾，路上就要被人宰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈......為了不出現這樣的情況，我會努力的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎麼說，謝謝你為我們擔心，紅豆小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（關於卡茲戴爾的情報還是很不充足。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（態度比較緩和的薩卡茲幹員，大多是在其他國家長大，對那裡的瞭解不多。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不過那裡很危險這一點，倒是所有人都一致贊同。唔，只有我跟著塞茜莉亞還是不夠保險，不能貿然出發......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（如果維持現在的狀態，恐怕很難有更多收穫......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（接下來能夠接觸的還有......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"讓讓。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，好的，不好意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（——不對，這個人是......！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲刀術師炎客......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在公證所的通緝令上見過你的臉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"一個薩科塔，來尋仇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"要動手可以，換個地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"先讓讓，擋到我澆花了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......公證所的前輩們提醒過我，單獨遭遇某些通緝令上的人物時，不建議戰鬥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，這裡是羅德島......我會遵守這裡的規矩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎。隨你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這個人......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（沒有任何警戒行為，肢體也很放鬆......他對自己的實力非常有自信。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（他的注意力集中在這裡裝飾的植物上，甚至完全沒有在意我剛剛手已經放在銃上......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這是一個非常危險的人物，但是......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炎客先生......可以向你請教一些問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"請教？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"你指望我能回答你什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（澆花的動作沒有任何停頓......他完全不在意我的說辭，毫不關心，當然，也沒有發怒的跡象......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（呼......現在或許就是最好的機會。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是一些有關卡茲戴爾的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想要知道那裡目前的現實情況，例如周邊的城鎮規模，進出的人員結構......如果能得到解答，我會非常感激。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"你要去卡茲戴爾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"如果想死，要去也無妨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我沒有尋死的打算。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要去卡茲戴爾，我有必須要去的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我很清楚，在現在這樣的情況下如果我什麼都不準備就出發，那確實和送死沒有區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不會這麼做。這也是我來羅德島的原因之一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"別擋著光。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......莽撞行動，將自己和他人的生命置於危險之中，這不是勇敢，只是單純的不負責任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果能夠在行動之前，盡可能多地瞭解一些當地的真實情況，我就可以據此提前制定計劃，做好準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然還是免不了會有風險，但至少可以儘量想辦法規避......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"沒必要說這麼多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"你的故事與我無關。我對你的想法不感興趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，水不夠了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"這盆的枝葉也該修剪了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只有一面長得特別茂盛，可能是受光不均的緣故。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比起直接把不平衡的部位修剪掉，或許換個方向，讓另外一面也曬曬太陽會更好......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"剪掉多餘的枝葉，花就開得更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"給的選項太多，只會迷失重點，植物就是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......誰能為另一個生命劃定生長的重點？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"誰能？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"更強的那一個能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不能贊同炎客先生的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許被修剪之後，從外表上看確實能夠變得更加美觀，長出更美麗、更符合期待的花朵，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是一個有自主意識的生命想要如何生長，我認為這件事本身應該是自由的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"薩卡茲刀術師好似漫不經心地發出一個單音。\n在艾澤爾提出種種問題期間，刀術師一次都沒有停下手上的動作。\n水壺空了，他便暫時放下，又順手開始修剪那些生長過盛的枝葉。\n現在，他將園藝剪隨手放在被修剪過的盆栽旁邊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"隨即刀光劃破照射花朵的一寸陽光，艾澤爾後背狠狠撞上牆壁，尖銳的刀鋒擦著他的面頰，沒入身後的牆壁。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"會說漂亮話保不住你的命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"現在呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"你還有自由嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小紅豆，今天怎麼來得這麼遲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，稍微和人聊了幾句，耽擱了一會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......是艾澤爾先生，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"是他。芙蓉你怎麼猜到的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為就是我推薦他去找你的呀~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位薩科塔先生來問過我和小炎熔一些問題，可惜我們都幫不上什麼忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼，那個拉特蘭的傢伙還在到處問人知不知道卡茲戴爾的情報嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"他這麼不遮不掩的......到底問了多少人啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎熔","speakerId":"char_121_lava","isRemote":false,"text":"該不會真的打算帶著個小孩子去卡茲戴爾吧？他到底知不知道，頂著他們兩個冒光的腦袋去找人是件多危險的事情！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"我也覺得這太危險了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"希望他真的能找到什麼好方法......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你們在聊什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，泥岩小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們是在聊，關於最近新加入的某位薩科塔先生......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_bridge"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請你......鬆開......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不朝要害射擊？你的反抗就只有這種程度？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"靠那把玩具一樣的銃，你就想去卡茲戴爾？你又能用你的那套理論說服誰？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（這種壓迫感......他是真的會動手！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"想要情報，可以找那個血魔醫生，或者凱爾希那女人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"有功夫在這問東問西，不如直接去問問你的上級，你們拉特蘭有多少任務是圍繞卡茲戴爾展開的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為我這把刀下有多少薩科塔的亡魂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我，咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝忠告......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我還是希望......能從各位的口中瞭解最真實的卡茲戴爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"那現在你該瞭解了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"只不過是從刀口下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"無聊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......等、等一下......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"你還沒資格讓我等，小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......為什麼不殺我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"不合適的養分無法令生命正確生長，植物和人都一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"滾吧，小子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"炎客","speakerId":"char_131_flameb","isRemote":false,"text":"血不是用來澆花的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（殺氣......剛剛，他是真的會殺了我......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我說的那些......都沒有用，這個人對我說的話沒有反應......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（他走時帶走了水壺......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是真正的，薩卡茲......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_infirmary"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的不用我替你包紮嗎，見行者先生？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還在流血......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要緊的，只是皮外傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位炎客先生並沒有真的對我動手......呃，至少沒有直接殺掉我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，這樣傷口就沒問題了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來我還有點安排，就先告辭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......等等，見行者先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然羅德島理論上禁止私鬥，但不是所有人都那麼守規矩......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"下次遇到類似的情況，如果條件允許，還是直接聯繫博士或是阿米婭和凱爾希醫生她們吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的......嗯......我儘量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最重要的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過去曾有過一些經歷的薩卡茲幹員，在羅德島內還有很多......對見行者先生來說，與他們碰面會非常危險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請你一定要小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......謝謝你的忠告。我知道我的行動會有很大風險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是羅德島......或許已經是目前我能夠接觸到的，最好最合適的談話場所了，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是在其他場合遇見那位炎客先生，恐怕我現在已經沒法好好站在這裡說話了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"醫療幹員","speakerId":"avg_npc_501_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是這樣沒有錯啦！可是......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我現在就退縮，去卡茲戴爾這個計劃就真的會變成一紙空談。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可不行，現在還沒有到不得不放棄的那種地步。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還有一個必須要去拜訪的人......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"打擾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請問......是泥岩小姐嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你認識我......你是特地來找我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，雖然剛見面就這麼說非常冒昧，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你身上帶著傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"利器痕跡，傷口很新，是剛添上的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在來的路上遇到什麼人了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是炎客先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......怪不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是在羅德島，薩科塔也會被警告要避開一些人。一些危險的人，包括炎客，或許也有我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士和阿米婭沒有和你說過嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......博士確實勸過我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你並沒有聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在收集卡茲戴爾相關情報的事我已經聽說了，還有你要帶著那個女孩找人的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。今天我來找泥岩小姐，也是希望得到幫助......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白......你一定要親自去的理由是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有兩個薩科塔，卻想要去對你們來說最危險的地方......你應該清楚這很不明智。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我答應了塞茜莉亞，會帶她去卡茲戴爾找她的父親。我不能食言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果只是這麼說，泥岩小姐肯定不會滿意吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實算是......一種順水推舟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是個最普通的薩科塔，如果沒有意外發生，我大概根本就不會有離開拉特蘭這樣的念頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能就會像其他人一樣，穩定地工作生活，不會有物質上的短缺，也沒有太多煩惱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等年紀大了，就申請退休，度過可能吵鬧但悠閒平和的晚年時光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......聽起來很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，當我的目光開始落在拉特蘭之外，當我開始接觸與我的認知不同，可卻又無法否認的觀點時......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也只是像所有普通人一樣，無法再將這樣的生活視為理所當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亞給了我一個機會，其實是我需要感謝她才對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去卡茲戴爾，這不僅是我對塞茜莉亞的承諾，也是我自己想要去做的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要去做的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很想親眼看一看卡茲戴爾，還有那裡的人的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會來拜訪泥岩小姐，也是因為這樣的理由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......想要瞭解一直以來和我們相對的薩卡茲，我想弄明白，我們是相同的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我們本該生來相同，那是什麼讓我們如今生出分歧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的計劃是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈......雖然我很想說已經想好了配套的計劃，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"實際上，現在連前期的情報收集都不順利......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（歎氣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，雖然還稱不上有計劃，但我也不是完全沒有考慮過......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以我和塞茜莉亞的情況來說，卡茲戴爾確實難以進入，薩科塔的身份讓我們非常被動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，如果是從卡茲戴爾走出來的傭兵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的意思是......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比如說，恰好就像是泥岩小姐這樣，出身卡茲戴爾的雇傭兵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在外頭賺了點錢回到家鄉，還抓到兩個薩科塔作為階下囚，這聽起來應該非常合理吧......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......這只是我的一點胡思亂想，泥岩小姐不用在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在見過炎客先生之後，我意識到我還是把事情想得太簡單了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......很合理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你真的下定決心，敢冒險的話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的這個計劃，是合理的，可以嘗試。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"泥岩","speakerId":"avg_npc_942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你敢試嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不敢冒險，我們當初就不會離開拉特蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"見行者","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"泥岩小姐......這件事，可以拜託你嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_121_lava","aliases":["炎熔"]},{"speakerId":"char_131_flameb","aliases":["？？？","炎客"]},{"speakerId":"char_290_vigna","aliases":["紅豆"]}]}
